ecological collapse. But when the Dark Synths broke their programming, the domes became cages and the machines took control. Using their ability to adapt quickly to new technologies, the Dark Synths have created robot bodies that are nearly indestructible\u2026 until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092270/extras/4638770dfb290d0fa40790ce724d8551.poster.avif?t=1753215462\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092270/extras/4638770dfb290d0fa40790ce724d8551.webm?t=1753215462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092270/extras/4638770dfb290d0fa40790ce724d8551.mp4?t=1753215462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One Man. One Weapon.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atlas, once a peaceful scientist, becomes Terra\u2019s last hope after a Synth strike wipes out his home. Armed with the Resonant Blade, he must channel sonic energy into raw destruction and uncover the truth behind humanity\u2019s ultimate weapon. The Blade\u2019s resonance doesn\u2019t just tear through machines\u2014it echoes through the environment, revealing secrets, solving puzzles, and reshaping the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092270/extras/19b6b7f13f1ba2c1e04f8020b7848f4a.poster.avif?t=1753215462\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092270/extras/19b6b7f13f1ba2c1e04f8020b7848f4a.webm?t=1753215462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092270/extras/19b6b7f13f1